  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(64 fotos)La tarde-noche de este jueves se han entregado en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura los premios de la&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=61124\" target=\"_blank\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\"><b>campa&ntilde;a de Navidad de Onda Centre Comercial (OCC), cuyo sorteo se realiz&oacute; el pasado lunes</b></span></font></a><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">. Tambi&eacute;n se ha presentado la campa&ntilde;a de San Valent&iacute;n, que ser&aacute; del 20 de enero al 15 de febrero.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremiscampanyaoccnadal1516/p1330109.jpg\" alt=\"p1330109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremiscampanyaoccnadal1516/p1330111.jpg\" alt=\"p1330111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremiscampanyaoccnadal1516/p1330112.jpg\" alt=\"p1330112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremiscampanyaoccnadal1516/p1330114.jpg\" alt=\"p1330114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremiscampanyaoccnadal1516/p1330116.jpg\" alt=\"p1330116\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremiscampanyaoccnadal1516/p1330117.jpg\" alt=\"p1330117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremiscampanyaoccnadal1516/p1330119.jpg\" al